                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='32' forceUpdate='true' h='4445' id='17' type-v2='text' w='24500' x='500' y='22667'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#2c4f50' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'> OVERVIEW</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#e3eaea' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='32' forceUpdate='true' h='4445' id='12' type-v2='text' w='61563' x='25000' y='22667'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#2c4f50' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>  ANALYSIS</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#e3eaea' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='33000' id='182' type-v2='text' w='35500' x='46000' y='25889'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='12'>This KPI evaluates diagnosis claims over a 5-year lookback for all patients in Patient360, flagging claims with predefined ICD-10 codes indicating clinically severe conditions. Severity is determined based on distinct service dates with such codes: patients with ≥2 dates are classified as </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='12'>Severe</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='12'>, while those with fewer are </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='12'>Attenuated</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='12'>.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>&quot;NOTE:  Business rules to define severity are in the process of being refined&quot;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='73333' id='472' type-v2='text' w='80688' x='5688' y='26889'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Care Team Record Type Definitions:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>First Dx HCP (5yr)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - The HCP from the patient’s earliest diagnosis claim in the 5-year diagnosis window. HCPs are ranked by earliest diagnosis date ascending</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>First Tx HCP (5yr)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - The HCP from the patient’s earliest treatment claim in the 5-year treatment window. HCPs are ranked by earliest treatment date ascending</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Last Infusion HCP</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - The HCP from the patient’s most recent treatment claim in the 5-year treatment window. Claims are ranked by treatment date descending</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Last Visited HCP</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - The HCP from the patient’s most recent overall claim in the 5-year combined claims window. Claims are ranked by claim date descending</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Most recently treated HCP (2yr)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - The HCP from the patient’s most recent treatment claim in the refresh window of 2 years. Claims are ranked within each patient by prioritizing non-null NPI first, then latest treatment date descending</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Most seen HCP1 (3yr)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - The top-ranked HCP based on distinct visit dates in the 3-year combined claims window. HCPs are ranked by visit count descending, then most recent visit date descending</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Most seen HCP2 (3yr)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - The second-ranked HCP based on distinct visit dates in the 3-year combined claims window. Ranking is by visit count descending, then most recent visit date descending</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Most seen HCP3 (3yr)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - The third-ranked HCP based on distinct visit dates in the 3-year combined claims window. Ranking is by visit count descending, then most recent visit date descending</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Most seen HCP4 (3yr)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - The fourth-ranked HCP based on distinct visit dates in the 3-year combined claims window. Ranking is by visit count descending, then most recent visit date descending</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Most seen HCP5 (3yr)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - The fifth-ranked HCP based on distinct visit dates in the 3-year combined claims window. Ranking is by visit count descending, then most recent visit date descending</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#666666' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
